{"version":1,"content":"<p>SpaceX近日獲得美國聯邦通信委員會（FCC）批准，可在太空部署多達100萬顆數據中心衞星。不過，這項批准附帶一項重要保留：SpaceX原本希望獲準將不再需要的衞星送入繞地球的處置軌道，或送入以太陽為中心的日心處置軌道，但FCC決定暫緩處理這一請求，理由是SpaceX未能充分説明相關處置方式是否符合監管要求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588328.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.303212+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:52:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"ad3f9b393e7e5bef0e767535ae31002f1ba37b3723f04e8b2765db32c9f20124","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}